 is  relatively simple  i think it deserves a solid s tier from  how cute  chill and relatable baby yoda is in this  moment  for the next cute baby yoda moment we  have him trying to fly the ship  to start out this scene we have a cute  upside down baby yoda  he's basically solid snake stealthing  around the ship and that thought alone  is priceless but looking at the actual  segment of him trying to fly the ship  it makes for a pretty funny scenario  although this moment  isn't necessarily cute it still makes  for a funny interaction  we were on the verge of greatness we  were this close  although it's immediately interrupted by  denjarin and for that alone  i have to lower it to a b din jaren  should have just let the whole moment  play out and see where baby yoda would  have went  maybe he was trying to go to chuck e  cheese but we'll never know  unfortunately  going on to another big moment we have  baby yoda force choking kara dune  this is where we truly see the evil side  of baby yoda  although this is a little dark it is  still kind of cute that baby yoda is  protecting denjarin from kara  and after the fact he doesn't even know  what he did wrong  he's just being a little kid in his eyes  and he can just see his innocence  but because of the fact that this moment  is more dark than it is cute  i have to put this moment in the d tier  for the next cute baby yoda moment we  probably have one of the most  controversial moments for this  character and that is him eating the  baby eggs  from frog lady although from the  perspective of baby yoda  these moments seem pretty cute but from  the perspective of frog lady  we have a murdering psychopath eating  all of her unborn children  oh baby yoda just ate an egg how cute he  must be so hungry  but in this instance baby yoda is almost  committing genocide because these are  the last eggs of the species  it's her spawn she needs her eggs  fertilized by the equinox or her line  will end  he's doing this all in the name of a  good snack  and i'm sorry baby yoda you may get  hungry at times  but that does not allow you to kill  unborn children  so for that on its own i'll give these  moments a c  and the only reason why these moments  get a c is because of how  god damn cute baby yoda is while  committing genocide  looking at the next episode we have an  immediate redemption arc for baby yoda  while denjarin drops baby oda off at  daycare  he gets to watch babies hatch from their  eggs  baby yoda actually has a character arc  in this scenario  and he learns from his faults of being  blinded by hunger and doing horrible  things from seeing these babies hatch  from their eggs  baby yoda learns that life is precious  and this whole scenario is just really  cute  and with the added benefit of baby yoda  getting to play  with little frog babies  it's also very cute how baby yoda  desperately wanted to stay  and keep playing with the babies the  only downside for this moment is that it  is very short  and the audience just wants more of it  for that alone i think it is fair to  give this moment a solid b  god dammit denjarin you should have  listened to baby yoda and adopted one of  the frog babies so baby yoda could have  a friend  so for the next cute moment we have baby  yoda taking the cookies  in this situation baby yoda is actually  being chill  and asks for a cookie but since the kid  is rude and ignores baby yoda  he takes action  oh these cookies i gotta get the recipe  from liz  put that cookie down now  although it is bad to steal but turning  down baby yoda is basically a crime  against humanity  he shows that stubborn little kid who's  boss and babieta whips out a cookie  and eats one right in his face so that  alone is  badass and freaking cute this is also  one of the main scenes where baby yoda  is completely by himself  in terms of characters and he is still  able to keep things fun  and interesting that paired with him  being very cute in this moment being  very relatable  i'll give this moment a solid a  within the same episode we have another  iconic baby yoda moment  and that is the theme park style ride in  the ship  i think this is essentially peak baby  yoda cuteness  i don't know what they could have done  to make this any better we have baby  yoda vibing and having a great time  him cheering whenever denjarin takes out  a tie fighter  he's showing his priorities of being  hungry and eating cookies  and it even caps off the moment with a  funny reaction to din jarn's crazy  flying with him puking  i just love the thought that baby yoda  is treating this whole moment like a  theme park ride  some people may be turned off by the  fact that baby ota threw up  but it just adds to his adorable factor  that he overdosed on too much  fun and cookies this moment to me  deserves to be in the s tier  going on to the next moment we have baby  yoda being an electrical mechanic  this moment is oddly relatable everyone  has gone through that moment with their  parents where they need help setting up  that tv  and you're the only one small enough to  get behind the tv and plug in different  wires  this moment accentuates that perfectly  and it brings in a nice flare of  cuteness as always  another thing that adds a lot to this  moment is that den jarn and baby yoda  are basically having  a conversation that on its own is  amazing  and that factor really boosts the comedy  baby yoda's just sitting there confused  by the instructions  and denjarin is somehow keeping his  composure  the chemistry between these two pals  boosts the cuteness factor into the  heavens  and i think that this moment deserves a  solid a  for the next cute moment we have baby  yoda eating an exotic meal  poor baby yoda is just hungry and  denjarn has not been allowing him to eat  any more eggs how dare he  so now baby yoda has to eat some yucky  meal in a tavern  but plot twist the kraken is in his bowl  baby yoda is dying in front of his dad  and he just acts like