  resonant than that  and i'm prepared to fight anyone in the  comments that disagrees  initially i was going to give this an a  but with the emotionally strong finale  paired with the fact that baby yoda got  to interact with r2d2  and luke skywalker i'll give this an s  this is just truly a perfect send-off to  baby yoda  assuming this is his final scene  so yeah that about wraps up this cute  baby yoda tier list  i know there are technically other  moments from baby yoda that could have  been included  but to me these were the 12 most popular  moments from baby yoda  some honorable mentions would include  baby yoda's relationship with the ball  and him force throwing stormtroopers but  i still think this is a solid list make  sure to like the video  subscribe and comment about what moments  you would put in the s tier and if you  would change anything  i hope you enjoyed the video and if this  jokey cheerless does well i'd be down to  make more like it and i could even apply  it to different shows
 

